WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.813
Things were not going well for Amy March.

2
00:00:04.814 --> 00:00:11.921
"Oh, why, oh, why did I have to get these horrid limes," she lamented to herself.

3
00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:17.623
It's true that Amy wanted to be popular or at least liked by the popular girls.

4
00:00:17.624 --> 00:00:25.925
She had always wanted to be the center of attention and experience what it would be like to have everyone look up to her.

5
00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:29.989
She would get her wish shortly, but not in the way she hoped.

6
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:36.032
"Miss March," Mr. Davis called to her, still hitting the menacing stick against his hand.

7
00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:43.373
Amy felt her throat go dry, and the hairs on her neck stood up stiff.

8
00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:46.385
"Stand up," the teacher ordered.

9
00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:54.298
Next to her, Amy could hear Kitty whimpering and from the corner of her eye, she saw Jenny smiling wickedly at her.

10
00:00:54.299 --> 00:01:04.254
That did it. Amy had disobeyed Mr. Davis' rule, but she was not a coward; she would accept whatever punishment fit the crime.

11
00:01:04.255 --> 00:01:12.465
Her parents had taught her that when she misbehaved, she should confess and face the consequences with dignity and humility.

12
00:01:12.466 --> 00:01:17.680
With shaking legs, and trying her best to hide her trembling hands, Amy stood up.

13
00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:22.415
"Do you have a bag of limes in your desk?" Mr. Davis asked.

14
00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:26.421
"Yes, sir, I do," Amy replied bluntly.

15
00:01:26.422 --> 00:01:35.085
All the girls gasped loudly and some of them (Amy suspected Kitty was one) even began crying.

16
00:01:35.086 --> 00:01:43.163
"Bring your bag and yourself up here." Mr. Davis tapped his desk at the front of the room with the stick.

17
00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:53.380
Reaching into her desk, Amy grabbed the bag of limes (nineteen still remaining) and began the dreaded walk to where Mr. Davis stood.

18
00:01:53.381 --> 00:02:02.152
Amy could feel the eyes of her classmates burning the back of her head as she passed them, but she refused to look at anyone.

19
00:02:02.153 --> 00:02:10.068
All she could think about was how disappointed Mother and her sisters would be after they heard about this incident.

20
00:02:10.069 --> 00:02:14.329
"Do you not know what I said about limes in my classroom?"

21
00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:18.340
Mr. Davis shouted suddenly, causing Amy to shrink back.

22
00:02:18.341 --> 00:02:22.033
Grabbing the bag of limes, he walked briskly to the window,

23
00:02:22.034 --> 00:02:29.184
opened it with his stick, and to the horror of all observers, emptied the contents onto the streets below.

24
00:02:29.185 --> 00:02:35.810
Then, turning around, he looked at Amy and said: "Miss March, you have greatly disappointed me.

25
00:02:35.811 --> 00:02:41.816
I do not delight in what I am about to do, but I am a man who keeps his word."

26
00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:47.653
He walked over to her and commanded her to open her hands, palms facing upward.

27
00:02:47.654 --> 00:02:55.054
Lifting the stick high above his head, he slapped her palms once, twice, then three times more.

28
00:02:55.055 --> 00:03:00.524
Each slap, painful as it was, was nothing compared to how the teacher hurt Amy next.

29
00:03:00.525 --> 00:03:05.058
"To remind others who think they can get away with breaking my rules,

30
00:03:05.059 --> 00:03:11.012
you, Miss March, will stand here in front of the class for the remainder of the morning lesson,

31
00:03:11.013 --> 00:03:19.435
as a living example of what happens to those who disrespect, disobey, and disregard my words."

32
00:03:19.436 --> 00:03:24.066
Mr. Davis positioned Amy in front of the blackboard so that everyone in the class

33
00:03:24.067 --> 00:03:29.129
had a clear view of her and would have to continue to look at her shame throughout the morning.

34
00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:36.778
For Amy, this was the most humiliating, not to mention most heartbreaking experience she ever had in her life.

35
00:03:36.779 --> 00:03:42.890
She acknowledged her wrongdoing and willingly received the punishment of five slaps on her hands.

36
00:03:42.891 --> 00:03:49.661
This, however, to be displayed like a common criminal, was too excessive and unbearable for the young girl.

37
00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:58.994
Still, she kept her head high, refused to let the teacher or her classmates see her internal suffering, and did not shed a single tear.

38
00:03:58.995 --> 00:04:06.709
Even so, at that precise moment Amy resolved in her heart that she would never return to school again.

39
00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:10.538
After Amy got home, she spilled her heart out to her family.

40
00:04:10.539 --> 00:04:19.816
Everyone, including Beth, who usually saw the good in all people and situations, agreed that Mr. Davis behaved inappropriately.

41
00:04:19.817 --> 00:04:27.859
"Poor Amy. I wish I could have taken your place," Beth wept along with her younger sister.

42
00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:34.860
"Take her place?" shouted Jo, who stopped pacing to throw her fist up and shake it vigorously.

43
00:04:34.861 --> 00:04:40.505
"If it were me, I would have smacked him right across the jaw and knock him down!

44
00:04:40.506 --> 00:04:47.475
In fact, I think I just may do that! How dare he humiliate my sister in this way?"

45
00:04:47.476 --> 00:04:55.064
For once Amy did not rebuke Jo for her unladylike behavior or her aggressive boyish attitudes.

46
00:04:55.065 --> 00:05:02.846
Mother, however, was concerned, although in her heart, she was in complete agreement with her short-tempered daughter.

47
00:05:02.847 --> 00:05:09.550
"Jo, where will violence get you? Do you think taking revenge is the solution to this problem?"

48
00:05:09.551 --> 00:05:13.398
Jo, cracking her knuckles, did not answer her mother.

49
00:05:13.399 --> 00:05:20.253
Mother continued in a patient yet firm voice: "Violent thoughts lead to violent acts.

50
00:05:20.254 --> 00:05:25.381
Your father and I do not want any of our girls to be revengeful.

51
00:05:25.382 --> 00:05:29.735
We must think with our heads; not react with our hearts."

52
00:05:29.736 --> 00:05:34.576
"I agree with you, Mother, but I can understand Jo's point of view as well.

53
00:05:34.577 --> 00:05:42.021
I don't think we should allow Mr. Davis to get away with such maltreatment of his pupils," Meg unexpectedly spoke up.

54
00:05:42.022 --> 00:05:46.918
Nodding, Mother soothed her youngest daughter's head which was lying across her lap.

55
00:05:46.919 --> 00:05:52.914
Looking down at her, "Amy, dearest, you are the victim of this distressing affair.

56
00:05:52.915 --> 00:05:55.389
What do you think should be done?"

57
00:05:55.390 --> 00:06:03.066
Sniffing and hiccupping, Amy answered in a hoarse voice: "I want to forget everything that happened today.

58
00:06:03.067 --> 00:06:06.061
But I don't want to go back to school.

59
00:06:06.062 --> 00:06:10.773
I can't, Mother. I won't learn from him. I don't want to."

60
00:06:10.774 --> 00:06:15.597
Mother continued to stroke her hair, considering Amy's request.

61
00:06:15.598 --> 00:06:20.687
"Amy and I could homeschool together, Mother," suggested Beth.

62
00:06:20.688 --> 00:06:26.837
"It will be so much nicer for me to have a fellow pupil than to do my lessons on my own."

63
00:06:26.838 --> 00:06:30.961
"Please, Mother, may I stay at home with Beth and study here?

64
00:06:30.962 --> 00:06:36.008
Please don't send me back to that dreadful place," pleaded Amy.

65
00:06:36.009 --> 00:06:44.109
"I can spare a few hours a week helping the girls with their lessons," offered Jo, who thought Amy's idea was an excellent one.

66
00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:47.860
"And I can check their homework," proposed Meg.

67
00:06:47.861 --> 00:06:51.954
Mother looked at each daughter with approval and appreciation.

68
00:06:51.955 --> 00:06:55.403
"Yes, I think that will be the best for now.

69
00:06:55.404 --> 00:07:01.213
Of course after Father returns from the war, he will have the final say in the matter.

70
00:07:01.214 --> 00:07:06.054
For now, however, Amy, you may stay home and do your lessons."

71
00:07:06.055 --> 00:07:10.597
Happily, Amy sprang up and hugged her mother and sisters.

72
00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:15.064
"But you must promise to listen to your sisters and do your work.

73
00:07:15.065 --> 00:07:19.231
Studying at home will be no different from studying at school.

74
00:07:19.232 --> 00:07:23.315
Do you understand?" Mother asked in a warning tone.

75
00:07:23.316 --> 00:07:27.539
"Yes, Mother, I promise to faithfully do my lessons.

76
00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.806
Beth and I will be model pupils.

77
00:07:29.807 --> 00:07:35.093
Just you wait and see," Amy replied in her usual cheery way.

78
00:07:35.094 --> 00:07:40.207
Early the next morning, Mother paid a visit to Amy's school and teacher.

79
00:07:40.208 --> 00:07:50.770
She kindly thanked him for his efforts, collected Amy's belongings, and with a cool nod, left without a backward glance.

